    "data": "\"Your request for an adjustment was approved. Details of your request are below.&nbsp;<br /><br />$value -question(quotedbody)$\""
  },
  {
    "skin": "adjustment",
    "application": "blob",
    "name": "wf-text-1",
    "data": "\"<p>A new adjustment to a carrier invoice requires your approval. The request has been assigned to you and can be found in your <a href=\\\"https://fedextraining.iservicecrm.com/app/my-message-inbox\\\">My Message Inbox page</a>. Details about the request are listed below.&nbsp;<br><br><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"><strong>Adjustment Request Detail</strong></span><br>&nbsp;</p>\\n<table border=\\\"1\\\" cellpadding=\\\"5\\\" cellspacing=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; width: 600px;\\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td colspan=\\\"2\\\">\\n<h3><strong>Details</strong></h3>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>Requester Name:</strong></td>\\n<td>$value -customer(name)$</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>PRO Number:</strong></td>\\n<td>$value -case(property'PRO Number')$</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>Delivery Date:</strong></td>\\n<td>$value -case(property'Delivery Date')$</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>Email Address:</strong>&nbsp;</td>\\n<td>$value -question(fromemail)$</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>Team:</strong></td>\\n<td>$value -case(property'Team')$</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td colspan=\\\"2\\\">\\n<h3><strong>Carrier Detail&nbsp;</strong></h3>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>Carrier Name:</strong></td>\\n<td>$value -case(property'Carrier Name')$</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>Carrier Code:</strong></td>\\n<td>$value -case(property'Carrier Code')$</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>Carrier Adjustment Amount:</strong></td>\\n<td>$value -case(property'Carrier Adjustment Amount (AP)')$</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>Is this an increase or decrease to invoice?</strong></td>\\n<td>$value -case(property'is this an increase or decrease to billing')$</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>Reason</strong></td>\\n<td>$value -case(property'Reason')$</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>Details from agent:</strong></td>\\n<td>$form -id'prop:adjustment:reason detail for freight adjustment'$</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\""
